'''Capsule Clearance''' (アウトレットガチャ, ''Autoretto Gacha'', '''Outlet Gacha''') is a Seasonal Gacha Event that appears during the [[Premium Fair]] event. It features 5 Ubers from 2 different Seasonal Gacha Events.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 7%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 68%
}}

