==Trivia==
*During the April 2025 English run of this Gacha, using 500 Cat Food to roll would result in getting a glitched Unit on the 5th roll. This resulted in the Gacha being ended early.
*During the June 2026 English run of this Gacha, there was another bug, which also resulted in the Gacha being ended early, though this time it was added back after a few days.
*The floating presents in [[Reindeer Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Reindeer Terunζ]]'s design were reused for Capsule Clearance's Gacha Button and first Gacha Banner. Despite this, she couldn't be obtained from rolling the Gacha.

